    "notes": "San Francisco's fog station: psychedelic rock (playtest 2, 2026-10-02: \"There should be different stations and music in different regions\"). A phased, tremolo organ over a drone, a fuzz guitar that bends and runs up the mode, ride and tambourine, 104-128 bpm (src/audio/radio-compose-regional.ts, preset psych-band). It played rockabilly before playtest 2: the song names that named rockabilly were reworded, and every track id stayed, so a cut stays cut. Melodies are generated from each track's seed, so they are original. Cut a track by setting its status to vetoed.",
